<title>FINLAND: KONECRANES SAYS WINS $11 MLN CRANE ORDER.</title>
<headline>KONECRANES SAYS WINS $11 MLN CRANE ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish crane builder KCI Konecranes said on Friday it had won an order for two cranes worth &quot;well over $11 million&quot; from a port operator in the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;Konecranes VLC Corporation has won the international tendering for two big ship-to-shore container cranes to be delivered to the client on the east coast of the U.S.,&quot; Konecranes said in a statement.</p>
</text>
